<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-THAILAND BEAT HONG KONG 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-THAILAND BEAT HONG KONG 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand beat Hong Kong 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup Asian zone group six qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Kritsada Plandit 23, Natipong Sritong-In 78</p>
